.TH AUDIO_LOAD 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
audio_load \- Load a .wav from assets/ (e.g. "sfx/jump.wav"; any sample rate or channel count, converted at play time)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqaudio.h\(dq
.BI "Sound audio_load(const char *relative_path);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Load a .wav from assets/ (e.g. "sfx/jump.wav"; any sample rate or channel count, converted at play time). Requires EngineConfig.audio = true; without it, or when no audio device exists, the result is a zero Sound and playing it is silent. Not cached: two loads of the same file are two copies, so load each sound once per scene, in on_enter, into a static.
.SH RETURN VALUE
a Sound; zero (and logged) on failure. Free with audio_free in on_exit.
.SH MODULE
audio (src/engine/audio/audio.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR audio_play (3),
.BR audio_music (3),
.BR audio_free (3),
.BR gge\-assets (7),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
